            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione uma variável de classe chamada <code>retailers</code> que contenha uma lista de strings das lojas onde você pode comprar a câmera.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Camera\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;$800&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  model = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Canon EOS M6&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  retailers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Walmart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eBay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Amazon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Best Buy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>retailers</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>[</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
