            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" :\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A classe está sem nome</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com este código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há <code>:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A classe está sem nome.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual cabeçalho substituto nomeia corretamente esta classe como <code>Camera</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" :\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>class Camera:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Camera class:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>class \"Camera\":</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class Camera:</code>.</p></body></html>",
